  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic file SQLite: production corpus quality, eligibility and deletion are verified in separate regressions.",
    "Seven samples are exploratory; P95 and P99 can equal the maximum. No SLA or statistical confidence claim.",
    "Rust cold timing includes executable validation, startup, SQLite loading and JSON parsing; warm timing includes process IPC and watermark checks.",
    "SQLite-vec stores float32; cosine scores have a separate tolerance and zero-vector semantics are not assumed interchangeable.",
    "RSS is the parent sample after each case, not a sampled process-tree peak; native and Worker allocations are not included.",
    "OS page cache is not flushed; cold means a new Rust process and vector cache, not cold disk. Parent retains the reference cache in all modes, so RSS is not a per-mode memory comparison.",
    "Native audio timing includes base64 and IPC; TS reference uses the same float32 mixing and linear resampling."
  ],
